tool.puppet_warp.name = Kugobisa Ngemaphini
tool.puppet_warp.description = Chafata kuze unamatsisele luhlaka emaphuzwini lambalwa, bese uhudvula linye: inethi iyagobeka emaphinini, icine nobe ikhululeke ngendlela inkhetselo Yekucina lesho ngayo. Kwemukela kusebentisa lugucuko.
